silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_12_sous_position_for_music_concrete_anchor#musicengine silm:hasLongDescription "The MusicEngine is the Mittens vaccination record FVRCP-2026-03-15, entering as a typed evidence packet with provenance and validation envelope. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol '\\concept{MusicEngine} \\', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
